{
  "id": "motor-neuron-pool",
  "term": "motor neuron pool",
  "definition": "A motor neuron pool is the group of motor neurons whose output reflects the combined effects of incoming signals from descending corticomotor pathways and spinal reflex pathways. Its activity can be described in terms of how readily these neurons are recruited to produce a response.",
